Contact: support@immunomind.com
Description: Connects the Immunarch ecosystem to a rich variety of external
    tools and reference databases. Tool adapters capture validated analysis
    recipes, run software, preserve the resulting artifacts, and translate
    outputs back into annotated ImmunData objects.
